---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy | Moon Commerce Limited" description="How the Moon Commerce website handles cookies and browser storage." canonical="/cookies/">
  <PageIntro label="Website policies" title="Cookie Policy" description="This policy describes how the Moon Commerce website uses cookies and similar technologies." />
  <section class="section light legal-site">
    <div class="wrap"><div class="prose">
      <h2>What this site uses</h2>
      <p>The website code does not set first-party cookies or use browser storage. It does not run analytics, advertising or third-party tracking scripts. Fonts and graphic assets are served from this website.</p>

      <h2>Hosting and security</h2>
      <p>Cloudflare operates the hosting and delivery infrastructure. Infrastructure services may use technologies needed for security or traffic management if those features are enabled.</p>

      <h2>External websites</h2>
      <p>If you follow a link to another website, its provider may use cookies according to its own policies. Find out about personal information in our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    </div></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
